5. **No push.**

========================================================================
VERDICT LINE
========================================================================

**PASS** — Check enforces DNS-adjacent least privilege only through sealed UDP builtins (`bind_udp`/`udp_recv` → UdpCap exact or NetCap soft supersede; Http/Tcp/Bind wrong-granular deny). User `resolve_ipv4` is type-accept for UdpCap and **not** sealed-map gated; product remains NetCap residual without sealed body.

